<!--
Copy this file to ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md (user scope), or merge its contents into
an existing ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md.

Replace every /ABS/PATH/TO/ai-agent-skills with your local clone path.

Both references below are independent opt-ins. Keep only the lines you want:
sourcing runtime guidance does not imply sourcing Branch Context, and BC can be
sourced on its own.

Keep DOC_MAP.md with DEVELOPER_INSTRUCTIONS.md: it is the only index of the
task-specific runtime docs (PR reviews, database audits, ...). Without the
import, the agent finds them only if it carries out the "read DOC_MAP.md"
bootstrap step itself, which a session that opens with a skill or a background
task can skip.
-->

# Agent runtime references

@/ABS/PATH/TO/ai-agent-skills/shared/references/agent-runtime/DEVELOPER_INSTRUCTIONS.md
@/ABS/PATH/TO/ai-agent-skills/shared/references/agent-runtime/DOC_MAP.md
@/ABS/PATH/TO/ai-agent-skills/claude/EXECUTION_MODEL.md

# Branch Context

@/ABS/PATH/TO/ai-agent-skills/shared/references/branch-context/BRANCH_CONTEXT.md
